<title>USA: Camden Property nets $27.6 mln from offer.</title>
<headline>Camden Property nets $27.6 mln from offer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camden Property Trust said on Wednesday that Paine Webber Inc sold the 1.09 million shares it issued to eight institutions and that total net proceeds to the company were about $27.6 million.</p>
<p>The company said funds from the shelf registration deal were used to reduce debt.</p>
<p>The sale price of about $25.86 per share was based on the 10-day trailing average price as of and including October 10.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
